.TH SDL_SetLogOutputFunction 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_SetLogOutputFunction \- Replace the default log output function with one of your own.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_log.h>
.PP
.BI "void SDL_SetLogOutputFunction(SDL_LogOutputFunction callback, void *userdata);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I callback
an
.BR SDL_LogOutputFunction
to call instead of the default\[char46]
.TP
.I userdata
a pointer that is passed to
.BR callback \[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

